invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/pinned-checkers.sh
reason: lint-runtime-symbols stops checking that its clang is the pinned
  version. Its catch script runs it alone, without lint-toolchain, so
  another clang's code generation would decide which runtime calls each
  file pulls in. test/pinned-checkers.sh hands it an older stand-in clang
  and requires it to stop on the pin.

--- old
	$(call REQUIRE_PINNED,lint-runtime-symbols,$(CLANG_RV),version $(LLVM_MAJOR)\.,LLVM $(LLVM_MAJOR))
--- new
